Subject: [PATCH] Fix Mamba recurrent state cleanup across null gaps

Backport Luca Motz upstream vllm-project/vllm#55450 at 98ae7c068d7894346cfcfdb9a92b17a9308fcdc9 with focused sparse cleanup regressions.

Co-authored-by: Luca Motz <luca.motz@icloud.com>
---
